window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It’s a busy time within House Luanda. Women are finally choosing Warriors. A facility is being prepared for the first willing females from Earth.<br> <br> The time is drawing near for Grim and Lisa’s daughter to be presented, and Grim is struggling with it. The thought of his Queen being at risk terrifies him.<br> <br> Then Grim discovers another threat that affects not just his queen but every Tornian, Kaliszian, and person on Earth.<br> <br> New life and old grudges are revealed during this fragile time, and only the Goddess knows what will happen.</p>"; 
